	(text "One stimulating channel: [7] clamp + buffer -> [8] Howland pump -> [9] limiter link + PhotoMOS.\nThe three pages are the single-channel Rev 1 sheets, unchanged (nested 2026-11-24).\nPlaced 4 times (CH1-CH4). Until the return sheet exists (phase 3) each copy still carries the return parts:\nU13 (return PhotoMOS), U14 (park), RSHR1 (return shunt), J5 pin 2 (RET), TP28."
